      <item>
        <title>To accelerate scientific discovery and support @ENERGY’s Genesis Mission, the @BerkeleyLab-led SYNAPS-I project is using SAM 3 and DINOv3 to automate image segmentation. By pairing DINOv3’s global semantic context and fine-grained spatial localization with SAM 3’s pixel-level boundary extraction, the researchers are able to compress 3D volume labeling from a month of manual effort to ~15 minutes. Learn more about their work: https://go.meta.me/01aed3</title>
        <dc:creator>@AIatMeta</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>To accelerate scientific discovery and support <a href="https://nitter.net/ENERGY" title="U.S. Department of Energy">@ENERGY</a>’s Genesis Mission, the <a href="https://nitter.net/BerkeleyLab" title="Berkeley Lab">@BerkeleyLab</a>-led SYNAPS-I project is using SAM 3 and DINOv3 to automate image segmentation.<br>
<br>
By pairing DINOv3’s global semantic context and fine-grained spatial localization with SAM 3’s pixel-level boundary extraction, the researchers are able to compress 3D volume labeling from a month of manual effort to ~15 minutes.<br>
<br>
Learn more about their work: <a href="https://go.meta.me/01aed3">go.meta.me/01aed3</a></p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHNxF03MWkAAtKQ3.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
