      <item>
        <title>RT by @AIatMeta: Muse Spark 1.1 is now available on OpenRouter! This was highly requested by developers! Give it a whirl and let us know!</title>
        <dc:creator>@alexandr_wang</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Muse Spark 1.1 is now available on OpenRouter!<br>
<br>
This was highly requested by developers! Give it a whirl and let us know!</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Meta for Developers (@MetaforDevs)</b>
<p>
<p>Developer choice is core to what we're building.<br>
<br>
We’re excited to share that Muse Spark 1.1 is now available on <a href="https://nitter.net/OpenRouter" title="OpenRouter">@OpenRouter</a> for US-based developers.  <br>
<br>
Get started today 👉 <a href="https://bit.ly/4vvjSNa">bit.ly/4vvjSNa</a></p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHNXXMLTbsAElMlO.png" style="max-width:250px;" />


</p>
