      <item>
        <title>To demonstrate Meta AI&apos;s advanced reasoning and multimodal capabilities, we submitted a model to participate in the Asian Physics Olympiad’s theoretical exam. We’re happy to share that our model achieved a perfect score of 30/30, tying with the top 3 student contestants. We appreciate the APhO committee for letting our model participate in the competition: https://apho2026.kr/en/index.html</title>
        <dc:creator>@AIatMeta</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>To demonstrate Meta AI's advanced reasoning and multimodal capabilities, we submitted a model to participate in the Asian Physics Olympiad’s theoretical exam. We’re happy to share that our model achieved a perfect score of 30/30, tying with the top 3 student contestants.<br>
<br>
We appreciate the APhO committee for letting our model participate in the competition:  <a href="https://apho2026.kr/en/index.html">apho2026.kr/en/index.html</a></p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHNN5af4WIAIcYqG.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
