        <dc:creator>@shengjia_zhao</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Today we are launching Muse Spark 1.1, an upgrade to muse spark 1 that greatly improves agentic, coding, multimodal, and computer use capabilities. We're also launching the Meta Model API in public preview.<br>
