      <item>
        <title>RT by @AIatMeta: 1/ muse spark 1.1 is an industry-competitive agentic and coding model. across many agentic evals it rivals gpt-5.5 and opus-4.8. available now through the new meta model api and in meta ai. 🧵</title>
        <dc:creator>@alexandr_wang</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>1/ muse spark 1.1 is an industry-competitive agentic and coding model. across many agentic evals it rivals gpt-5.5 and opus-4.8.<br>
<br>
available now through the new meta model api and in meta ai. 🧵</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHMynlRnacAA9K01.png" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
